WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.640
What we're seeing with the increased national attention is bringing in nationally recognized influencers.

00:06.100 --> 00:09.720
They're going where they can get the views and create the perception.

00:10.500 --> 00:12.200
That's Chief Bob Day.

00:12.580 --> 00:19.120
The chief thinks the guy with the selfie stick at the riots is the problem, not the loon strapped with a machete.

